  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KIjanisha Afya project -strengthen climate resilie</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to enhance climate mitigation and adaptation actions that contribute to improving effectiveness in delivering primary health care services in these regions, including maternity and reproductive health services. This will be done by supporting installation of solar PV as a source of power in primary health centres alongside the deployment of energy-efficiency and solar-powered appliances. This will also reduce the use of charcoal and firewood as an energy source.</narrative>
  </description>
